# Backlog #0-141 (ADR-0030): an allowlist. The Dockerfiles package the jar Maven built and read nothing
# else from the build context, so nothing else is sent: no sources, no .git, no .env, no developer's
# application-local.yml. Until #0-141 the images compiled the sources and this file listed what to leave out.
# `*.jar.original` (the jar before Spring Boot repackages it) does not match the pattern.
*
!*-service/target/*-service-*.jar
